   detach_task_profile origin   (we can detach after lock, as we no longer need task profile for origin until later for dispatch slot allocation)

But we will need task profile again for origin allocate_dispatch_slot later. So we need to keep it linked or reattach later. Simpler: keep it linked until after allocate_dispatch_slot, then detach.

Thus we keep task profile linked from attach through allocate_dispatch_slot.

Thus after lock we keep it linked, then after we later do mark dispatch ready (doesn't need task profile) and allocate dispatch slot (needs), then detach.

